flowchart LR
    Human[Owner passkey] --> Ceremony[Exact origin and RP ceremony]
    Ceremony --> Session[Opaque bounded session]
    Reader[Reader token: script or AI client] --> Credential[Expiring revocable token]
    Session --> Authority[Current role and credential]
    Credential --> Authority
    Authority --> Gate[One route guard: minimum role per route]
    Gate --> Query[Query over all telemetry with evidence]
    Query --> Recheck[Publication-time authority recheck]
    Recheck --> Answer[Bounded no-store answer]
    Gate --> Intent[Owner-only durable mutation intent]
    Intent --> Control[Spindle control publication]
    Control --> Audit[Durable outcome audit]
    Host[Stopped service and host custody] --> Recovery[Protected owner recovery]
    Recovery --> Epoch[New credential epoch]
    Epoch --> Authority
    Spindle[Spindle token] --> Intake[Durable intake and config polling]
